  <item>
    <coll>Gtn</coll>
    <ref>Gtn010.004</ref>
    <rnb>157</rnb>
    <tib>kun tu bzang po thugs kyi me long gi rgyud zhes bya ba thams cad ston pa'i rgyud</tib>
    <skt>sa man d+ha tsi ta d+he ka tan tra na ma / sarba da na tan tra / A / sa man ta tsi ta d+he ka tan tra na sarba d+ha na tan a pa sha ni tri</skt>
    <coloph>ces kun tu bzang po rtsa ba'i rgyud chen po thugs kyi me long gi rgyud zhes bya ba / don thams cad gsal bar byed pa'i rgyud rdzogs so/ /ithi / rgya rgya rgya / rgya gsum gyis ma btab sha ra re / sngags kyi bsrungs ma e ka tsa ti mas bka' 'di'i bya ra gyis shig / rag mo khrem myags bhyo / rag mo dung thing bhyo / rag mo har hur snying rtsal bhyo / ma ma ru ru dri spa srog la bhyo bhyo / byas shing gos nag brdabs na rtags mod la 'ong ngo / thig le gsang bskor gi man ngag 'di ni / bi ma las sgra mi 'thun pa gsum las bsgyur ba lags so / byang chub sems dpa' khri srong lde btsan gyi thugs dam gsang ba yang khol du phyung ba lagso/ zha mgon srag zan gyis bsrungs cig / ging ka ra ging ka ra srog rtsal hur thums bhyo / dza hu'M baM ho / snying khrag bzhibs bzhibs/dza/ ces sgra 'byung ba'i dus su brjod cing bsob brdabs na rtags dngos su 'ong / rgya rgya rgya / /kha thaM kha thaM kha tham</coloph>
